  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Works To Flood-Proof Our Animal Hospital</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TOLFA has experienced significant flooding and structural damage from the annual monsoon as well as  unseasonable weather events since 2019. A result of climate change in the desert region of India in which we are based, these conditions are proving challenging in many ways. We have raised the floor level of some of our kennels and buildings, but require more funds to complete this work across our hospital and shelter. Severe flooding affects our sick &amp; injured animals as well as our staff.</narrative>
  </description>
